source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-24
observed: The bold closes on the last asterisk and the pair inside it breaks, so Jira renders one bold holding a forced newline and a literal asterisk; jiro reads a hard break inside the bold.
-- input.jira --
*ab\\cd*ef*
-- rendered.html --
<p><b>ab<br class="atl-forced-newline" />cd*ef</b></p>
-- want.md --
**ab\
cd\*ef**
-- warnings.json --
[]
